
flowchart TD
    A([Install QR Studio]) --> B[Open App]
    B --> C[Initialize App]
    C --> C1[Load persisted Redux settings]
    C1 --> C2[Restore local guest session from SecureStore]
    C2 --> C3[Initialize Firebase Auth listener]
    C3 --> D{First launch?}

    D -- Yes --> E[Onboarding: 3 slides]
    E --> F[Welcome Screen]
    F --> G[Get Started]
    G --> H[Sign In Screen]

    D -- No --> I{Valid local guest session?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Restore Guest State]
    I -- No --> K{Firebase user authenticated?}
    K -- Yes --> L[Restore Account State]
    K -- No --> H

    H --> M{Choose an option}

    M -- Sign In --> N[Enter email and password]
    N --> N1{Credentials valid?}
    N1 -- No --> N2[Show validation or auth error]
    N2 --> N
    N1 -- Yes --> O[Firebase Auth sign in]
    O --> O1{Authentication successful?}
    O1 -- No --> N2
    O1 -- Yes --> P{Local guest data exists?}

    M -- Create Account --> Q[Open Sign Up Screen]
    Q --> Q1[Enter name, email and password]
    Q1 --> Q2{Input valid?}
    Q2 -- No --> Q3[Show validation error]
    Q3 --> Q1
    Q2 -- Yes --> Q4[Create Firebase account]
    Q4 --> Q5{Account created?}
    Q5 -- No --> Q3
    Q5 -- Yes --> P

    M -- Forgot Password --> R[Enter registered email]
    R --> R1[Send Firebase password-reset email]
    R1 --> R2[Show success or error]
    R2 --> H

    M -- Continue as Guest --> S[Save guest session in SecureStore]
    S --> S1[Set localGuest.active = true]
    S1 --> S2[Open Main App]
    J --> S2
    L --> T[Load account profile and cloud data]
    T --> S2

    P -- Yes --> U[Offer local history migration]
    P -- No --> T
    U --> U1{User chooses to migrate?}
    U1 -- Yes --> U2[Validate and upload local records]
    U2 --> U3{All required records confirmed?}
    U3 -- No --> U4[Keep local data and show retry option]
    U4 --> U2
    U3 -- Yes --> U5[Confirm migration and mark records synced]
    U5 --> U6[Clear guest session only after safe migration]
    U6 --> T
    U1 -- Not now --> T

    S2 --> V[Main App: 3-Tab Bottom Navigation]

    V --> HM[Home Screen]
    V --> SC[Scan QR: Elevated Center Circular Button]
    V --> CR[Create QR Tab]

    HM --> HM1[Live Offline Metrics: Scanned, Created, Favorites]
    HM --> HM2[Quick Actions Grid]
    HM --> HM3[Recent Activity Feed]
    HM2 --> HI[History Screen via Quick Action]
    HM2 --> SE[Settings Screen via Header or Quick Action]
    HM3 --> HI

    HI --> HI_BACK[Back to Home Screen]
    HI_BACK --> HM

    SE --> SE_BACK[Back to Home Screen]
    SE_BACK --> HM

    SC --> SC1{Camera permission granted?}
    SC1 -- No --> SC2[Explain why camera is needed]
    SC2 --> SC3{User grants permission?}
    SC3 -- No --> SC4[Offer gallery scan or return]
    SC3 -- Yes --> SC5[Open live scanner with animated reticle]
    SC1 -- Yes --> SC5
    SC4 --> SC6{Choose gallery scan?}
    SC6 -- Yes --> SC7[Select image and decode code via scanFromURLAsync]
    SC6 -- No --> V
    SC5 --> SC8[Detect QR or supported 1D/2D barcode]
    SC7 --> SC9[Parse scanned content]
    SC8 --> SC9
    SC9 --> SC10[Show result card with contextual actions: URL, Wi-Fi, Phone, SMS, Email, Geo]
    SC10 --> SC11{Auto-save enabled?}
    SC11 -- Yes --> SC12[Save scan to local Redux/AsyncStorage history]
    SC11 -- No --> SC13[Keep result without auto-save]
    SC12 --> SC14{Signed-in account?}
    SC14 -- Yes --> SC15[Sync scan to Firestore]
    SC14 -- No --> SC16[Keep scan on device in offline storage]
    SC13 --> SC17{User manually saves?}
    SC17 -- Yes --> SC12
    SC17 -- No --> SC18[Return or continue]
    SC15 --> SC19{User requests AI explanation?}
    SC16 --> SC19
    SC18 --> V
    SC19 -- Yes --> SC20{Signed in and online?}
    SC20 -- Yes --> SC21[Call analyzeScan Cloud Function]
    SC21 --> SC22[Verify Auth, App Check and quota]
    SC22 --> SC23[Gemini analyzes payload]
    SC23 --> SC24[Show type, summary and risk hints]
    SC24 --> SC25{Save AI summary?}
    SC25 -- Yes --> SC26[Save summary to history]
    SC25 -- No --> V
    SC26 --> V
    SC20 -- No --> SC27[Explain AI needs account and connectivity]
    SC27 --> V
    SC19 -- No --> V

    CR --> CR1{Choose QR content type: 8 Offline Formats}
    CR1 --> CR2[URL or plain text]
    CR1 --> CR3[Wi-Fi credentials]
    CR1 --> CR4[Contact vCard, email, SMS or phone]
    CR1 --> CR5[Geographic coordinates]
    CR1 --> CR6[Smart Create: natural-language prompt]
    CR2 --> CR7[Validate payload]
    CR3 --> CR7
    CR4 --> CR7
    CR5 --> CR7
    CR6 --> CR8{Signed in, online and AI enabled?}
    CR8 -- Yes --> CR9[Call smartCreate Cloud Function]
    CR9 --> CR10[Validate output and build structured payload]
    CR10 --> CR7
    CR8 -- No --> CR11[Show unavailable message or use manual creation]
    CR11 --> CR1
    CR7 --> CR12[Generate QR locally with react-native-qrcode-svg]
    CR12 --> CR13[Customize colors, error correction L/M/Q/H and optional center logo]
    CR13 --> CR14[Live SVG Preview]
    CR14 --> CR15{Choose action}
    CR15 -- Edit --> CR13
    CR15 -- Save PNG --> CR16[Save PNG to device gallery via expo-media-library]
    CR15 -- Share --> CR17[Open native share sheet via expo-sharing]
    CR15 -- Save to history --> CR18[Save creation locally in Redux/AsyncStorage]
    CR15 -- Upload --> CR19{Signed-in account and online?}
    CR19 -- No --> CR20[Keep local creation and queue or retry upload]
    CR19 -- Yes --> CR21[Call signUpload Cloud Function]
    CR21 --> CR22[Verify Auth, App Check and quota]
    CR22 --> CR23[Return short-lived upload signature]
    CR23 --> CR24[Upload PNG to Cloudinary]
    CR24 --> CR25[Update creation image metadata in Firestore]
    CR25 --> CR26[Show upload success]
    CR16 --> CR18
    CR17 --> CR18
    CR18 --> CR27{Signed-in account?}
    CR27 -- Yes --> CR28[Sync creation metadata to Firestore]
    CR27 -- No --> CR29[Keep creation in offline local storage]
    CR20 --> CR29
    CR28 --> V
    CR29 --> V
    CR26 --> V

    HI --> HI1{Current mode}
    HI1 -- Guest --> HI2[Read local scans and creations from Redux Persist]
    HI1 -- Account --> HI3[Read account history from Firestore]
    HI2 --> HI4[Search, filter chips All/Scanned/Created/Favorites, favorite, copy, share or open]
    HI3 --> HI4
    HI4 --> HI5{Action}
    HI5 -- Tap card or View QR --> HI6[Open QR Preview Box Modal: Visual SVG QR + Given Input + Save PNG + Share QR]
    HI5 -- Favorite --> HI7[Update favorite locally or in Firestore]
    HI5 -- Delete --> HI8[Confirm deletion alert]
    HI5 -- Share --> HI9[Share saved content or QR image]
    HI6 --> HI
    HI7 --> HI
    HI9 --> HI
    HI8 --> HI10{Delete confirmed?}
    HI10 -- No --> HI4
    HI10 -- Yes --> HI11[Delete local record or Firestore document]
    HI11 --> HI12{Deleted creation has Cloudinary asset?}
    HI12 -- Yes --> HI13[onCreationDeleted trigger removes asset]
    HI12 -- No --> HI
    HI13 --> HI

    SE --> SE1[Theme system/light/dark, haptics, sound, auto-save and auto-open settings]
    SE1 --> SE2[Persist settings locally in AsyncStorage]
    SE2 --> SE3{Account actions?}
    SE3 -- No --> HM
    SE3 -- Create account or sign in --> H
    SE3 -- Sign out --> SE4[Clear Firebase session]
    SE4 --> SE5{Keep local guest data?}
    SE5 -- Yes --> SE6[Start or retain local guest session]
    SE5 -- No --> SE7[Confirm local data deletion]
    SE7 --> SE8[Delete only after confirmation]
    SE6 --> S2
    SE8 --> H
    SE3 -- Delete account --> SE9[Confirm irreversible deletion]
    SE9 --> SE10{Confirmed?}
    SE10 -- No --> SE1
    SE10 -- Yes --> SE11[Call deleteAccount Function]
    SE11 --> SE12[Delete user data, Cloudinary assets and Firebase Auth account]
    SE12 --> H
